From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:55:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 049/128] feat: reorder message menu items

The stored code order is applied as a stable sort in the same filter
that drops hidden items, so options absent from the saved order keep
their stock relative positions and everything stays consistent when new
menu items appear. The editor rows drag vertically (long press), each
drop persists the full order.

Confidence: medium
Scope-risk: narrow
Not-tested: drag feels on the device
---
